  "limitations": [
    "厂家原生外壳 CAD 与可追溯产品资料已接入；本型号的 ESP32 板级运行尚未实现，仍显示尚未完成适配。",
    "Native source coordinates preserved by one rigid transform; print duplicates and separate kit mounting adapters are explicitly omitted, never globally rescaled.",
    "Populated PCB is UNKNOWN; schematic connectivity is not fabricated as component placement or hidden structure.",
    "Paper/optics/connectors retain separate materials; exact hidden depths and some printed detail remain approximate.",
    "No real browser photo overlays, image decoding, embedded sharing or physical hardware acceptance claimed by the Node/static checks.",
    "Grove and other external interfaces remain without cable permission until exact mating orientation and signal routing are audited.",
    "Native source enclosure bounds23.99×48×8.55mm differ from nominal48×24×8mm; CAD is retained without squeezing it.",
    "No thermal frame, buzzer sound, RGB output or I2C slave result is fabricated. Front button remains part of the connected manufacturer molding; custom color treatment of that flexure is not individually calibrated.",
    "Rear black circular buzzer symbol is printed on continuous paper/CAD support, not modeled as an exposed component or opening. Optical rim is a photo approximation; actual buzzer remains on UNKNOWN PCB.",
    "Independent paper sheet display thickness0.01mm and image-face separation0.005mm are visualization estimates. Source photos establish continuous printed paper, including bridges over native slots; physical stock/adhesive thickness and deformation are unknown. No plastic backing is invented."
  ],
